https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-08-17T22:20:17Z","updated_at":"2014-08-17T22:20:17Z","body":"I cannot reproduce this. Can you give us the node version you're using, the file you're running it on, and the way you're invoking eslint?\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/52437369/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"michaelficarra","id":218840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxODg0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelficarra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/52450696","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/1164#issuecomment-52450696","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1164","id":52450696,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyNDUwNjk2","user":{"login":"skiadas","id":1728684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Mjg2ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1728684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas","html_url":"https://github.com/skiadas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-08-18T04:26:15Z","updated_at":"2014-08-18T04:26:15Z","body":"I'm using node v0.10.29, and I was simply trying \"eslint somefile.js\" from the command line right after installing eslint via npm. I actually cannot reproduce the problem by not having a .eslintrc file any more, but I can reproduce the error in the case of a completely empty .eslintrc file.\n\nTo reproduce, the following should work:\n1. New empty directory.\n2. New empty file `test.js`\n3. New empty file `.eslintrc`  (I used just `touch ...` to create those)\n4. Run `eslint test.js`\n\nThis example seems to crash a little bit sooner, or rather later (line 224 in config.js instead of 214), with the following:\n\n```\nTypeError: Cannot read property 'env' of null\n    at Config.getConfig (/usr/local/lib/node_modules/eslint/lib/config.js:224:74)\n    at processFile (/usr/local/lib/node_modules/eslint/lib/cli-engine.js:86:31)\n    at CLIEngine.<anonymous> (/usr/local/lib/node_modules/eslint/lib/cli-engine.js:172:34)\n    at walk (/usr/local/lib/node_modules/eslint/lib/util/traverse.js:76:9)\n    at /usr/local/lib/node_modules/eslint/lib/util/traverse.js:97:9\n    at Array.forEach (native)\n    at traverse (/usr/local/lib/node_modules/eslint/lib/util/traverse.js:96:11)\n    at CLIEngine.executeOnFiles (/usr/local/lib/node_modules/eslint/lib/cli-engine.js:161:9)\n    at Object.cli.execute (/usr/local/lib/node_modules/eslint/lib/cli.js:164:29)\n    at Object.<anonymous> (/usr/local/lib/node_modules/eslint/bin/eslint.js:3:20)\n```\n\nIt seems to me that `getLocalConfig` doesn't treat its edge cases very well.\n\nYou could argue the system shouldn't expect to have to handle a completely empty `.eslintrc` file, and really in practice this is not going to be a big issue, it just would be nice to have a more graceful reaction from eslint in this situation.\n\nI wish I could reproduce the original case, where the absence of a .eslintrc file was causing a crash, but I can't. At that stage the project was set up to use jshint, with some instructions related to that in `package.json`. But I don't see how that could be relevant to eslint.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/52450696/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"skiadas","id":1728684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Mjg2ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1728684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas","html_url":"https://github.com/skiadas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/52451731","html_url":"https://github.com/eslint/eslint/issues/1164#issuecomment-52451731","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/1164","id":52451731,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDUyNDUxNzMx","user":{"login":"skiadas","id":1728684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Mjg2ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1728684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas","html_url":"https://github.com/skiadas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-08-18T04:45:39Z","updated_at":"2014-08-18T04:45:39Z","body":"I did some further testing, the \"problem\" might be with `yaml.safeLoad` in `lib/config.js` line 47, in the `loadConfig` function. The call to `yaml.safeLoad` might return `null` instead of an empty object if it fails to process the file, thus setting `config` to null and making `loadConfig` return `null`. As other parts further down expect an object, this causes problems.\n\nChanging line 54 in `lib/config.js` from:\n\n```\n    return config;\n```\n\nto\n\n```\n    return config || {};\n```\n\nfixed it for me. (at least the version I could reproduce)\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/comments/52451731/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"skiadas","id":1728684,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3Mjg2ODQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1728684?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas","html_url":"https://github.com/skiadas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skiadas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":153791679,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDE1Mzc5MTY3OQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/eslint/eslint/issues/events/153791679","actor":{"login":"michaelficarra","id":218840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxODg0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/218840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelficarra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelficarra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github